        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>雀巢商业模式画布 - 战略模式</title>\n<style>\n  * {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n\n  body {\n    background-color: #e5e7ea;\n    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n    color: #222222;\n    padding: 30px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n\n  .canvas-wrapper {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 1200px;\n    background-color: #e5e7ea;\n  }\n\n  /* Header Styles */\n  .header-section {\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n  }\n\n  .top-bar {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n\n  .logo-group {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 12px;\n  }\n\n  .cn-logo {\n    font-size: 42px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: #00509e;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n\n  .en-logo {\n    font-size: 42px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: #00509e;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n\n  .logo-placeholder {\n    width: 60px;\n    height: 50px;\n    border: 2px dashed #00509e;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    color: #00509e;\n    text-align: center;\n    background-color: rgba(0, 80, 158, 0.05);\n  }\n\n  .main-title {\n    font-size: 46px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: #00509e;\n    letter-spacing: 4px;\n  }\n\n  .sub-title-bar {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n    margin-top: -5px;\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n  }\n\n  .strategic-text {\n    font-size: 24px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #00509e;\n    margin-right: 180px;\n  }\n\n  .company-text {\n    font-size: 38px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: #0f172a;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    margin-top: 2px;\n  }\n\n  .brand-intro {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    color: #333333;\n    text-align: justify;\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n  }\n\n  /* Canvas Grid Styles */\n  .grid-container {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(10, 1fr);\n    grid-template-rows: auto auto auto;\n    gap: 1px;\n    background-color: #64748b;\n    border: 1px solid #64748b;\n  }\n\n  .grid-cell {\n    background-color: #ffffff;\n    padding: 16px 14px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n  }\n\n  /* Column Positioning */\n  .cell-partners {\n    grid-column: 1 / span 2;\n    grid-row: 1 / span 2;\n  }\n\n  .cell-activities {\n    grid-column: 3 / span 2;\n    grid-row: 1 / span 1;\n  }\n\n  .cell-resources {\n    grid-column: 3 / span 2;\n    grid-row: 2 / span 1;\n  }\n\n  .cell-value {\n    grid-column: 5 / span 2;\n    grid-row: 1 / span 2;\n  }\n\n  .cell-relationships {\n    grid-column: 7 / span 2;\n    grid-row: 1 / span 1;\n  }\n\n  .cell-channels {\n    grid-column: 7 / span 2;\n    grid-row: 2 / span 1;\n  }\n\n  .cell-segments {\n    grid-column: 9 / span 2;\n    grid-row: 1 / span 2;\n  }\n\n  .cell-cost {\n    grid-column: 1 / span 5;\n    grid-row: 3 / span 1;\n  }\n\n  .cell-revenue {\n    grid-column: 6 / span 5;\n    grid-row: 3 / span 1;\n  }\n\n  /* Interior Typography & Spacing */\n  .cell-title {\n    font-size: 18px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: #00509e;\n    text-align: center;\n    letter-spacing: 0.35em;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n\n  .cell-subtitle {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: #2b7cb7;\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n  }\n\n  .content-text {\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    color: #222222;\n  }\n\n  .content-text p {\n    margin-bottom: 1em;\n  }\n\n  .content-text p:last-child {\n    margin-bottom: 0;\n  }\n\n  .text-blue {\n    color: #00509e;\n  }\n\n  .font-bold {\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n\n  /* Bottom Section Layouts */\n  .cost-split {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 15px;\n    margin-top: 8px;\n  }\n\n  .cost-item {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 8px;\n  }\n\n  .vertical-label {\n    width: 1.5em;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #111827;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n\n  .cost-desc {\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    color: #222222;\n  }\n\n  .revenue-content {\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    color: #222222;\n  }\n\n  .mt-4 {\n    margin-top: 1.2em;\n  }\n\n  .mt-6 {\n    margin-top: 1.8em;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"canvas-wrapper\">\n  <!-- Header Section -->\n  <div class=\"header-section\">\n    <div class=\"top-bar\">\n      <div class=\"logo-group\">\n        <div class=\"cn-logo\">雀巢</div>\n        <div class=\"logo-placeholder placeholder\">[Bird Nest Logo]</div>\n        <div class=\"en-logo\">Nestlē</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"main-title\">商业模式画布</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sub-title-bar\">\n      <div class=\"strategic-text\">战略模式--</div>\n      <div class=\"company-text\">全球TOP食品公司</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"brand-intro\">\n      【品牌简介】雀巢是全球知名的食品饮料公司。拥有从全球知名品牌，到各地受欢迎的本土产品，业务遍布全球一百多个国家和地区。从一个生产婴儿食品的乡村作坊发展成今天领先世界的食品公司，雀巢走过了130多年的发展历程。\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Canvas Grid Section -->\n  <div class=\"grid-container\">\n    <!-- 1. Key Partners -->\n    <div class=\"grid-cell cell-partners\">\n      <div class=\"cell-title\">重要伙伴</div>\n      <div class=\"cell-subtitle\">有效运作所需的供应商和<br>合作伙伴</div>\n      <div class=\"content-text\">\n        <p>对内<br>\n        全球80多个国家拥有500多家工厂，近25万名员工<br>\n        雀巢在全球拥有强大的食品和营养<span class=\"text-blue font-bold\">研究网络</span>，数千名科学家及技术人员在研发领域工作<br>\n        并<span class=\"text-blue font-bold\">与风险投资、研究合作伙伴和大学</span>保持着紧密的合作<br>\n        全球约30家产品技术中心和研发中心，为创新提供专业技术和识，支持业务增长</p>\n        <p class=\"mt-6\">电商与物流（国内<span class=\"text-blue font-bold\">菜鸟合作绿色供应链</span>）</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 2a. Key Activities -->\n    <div class=\"grid-cell cell-activities\">\n      <div class=\"cell-title\">关键业务</div>\n      <div class=\"cell-subtitle\">成功营运必需的重要业务模块</div>\n      <div class=\"content-text\">\n        <p class=\"text-blue font-bold\">聚研发-管理-并购三力，享全球食饮增长红利</p>\n        <p>1、<span class=\"font-bold\">通过创新和改造</span>加强公司的老字号品牌和基础业务；<br>\n        2、<span class=\"font-bold\">寻求新的内外部创新模式</span>，包括在雀巢旗下创立新的子公司；<br>\n        3、<span class=\"font-bold\">确保投资为雀巢铺设新的增长路径；</span><br>\n        4、在<span class=\"font-bold\">技术支持和能力增长</span>的同时<span class=\"font-bold\">进行策略性投资。</span></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 2b. Key Resources -->\n    <div class=\"grid-cell cell-resources\">\n      <div class=\"cell-title\">核心资源</div>\n      <div class=\"cell-subtitle\">模式运转所需的资源</div>\n      <div class=\"content-text\">\n        <p>在<span class=\"font-bold\">食品制造</span>领域内一百四十多年的<span class=\"font-bold\">经验</span>、对Z<span class=\"font-bold\">新营养和食品加工技术</span>的<span class=\"font-bold\">不断追求</span>、高<span class=\"font-bold\">质量原材料</span>的使用、Z<span class=\"font-bold\">高技术设备</span>的应用、<span class=\"font-bold\">高素质的员工及研发方面的巨额投资</span></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 3. Value Propositions -->\n    <div class=\"grid-cell cell-value\">\n      <div class=\"cell-title\">价值主张</div>\n      <div class=\"cell-subtitle\">为客户创造价值的产品<br>或服务</div>\n      <div class=\"content-text\">\n        <p><span class=\"font-bold\">理念：</span><br>\n        <span class=\"font-bold\">充分发掘食品的力量，提升每个个体的生活品质，无论当下还是未来。</span></p>\n        \n        <p class=\"mt-4\"><span class=\"font-bold\">主张：</span><br>\n        <span class=\"font-bold\">坚持诚信、合法经营，尊重员工和合作伙伴</span></p>\n        \n        <p class=\"mt-4\">雀巢研发网络将“质<span class=\"font-bold\">量源于设计</span>”的理念应用到所有的产品研发之中。</p>\n        \n        <p class=\"mt-4\"><span class=\"font-bold\">产品：</span><br>\n        <span class=\"font-bold\">咖啡、奶品、谷物和零食等</span></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 4a. Customer Relationships -->\n    <div class=\"grid-cell cell-relationships\">\n      <div class=\"cell-title\">客户关系</div>\n      <div class=\"cell-subtitle\">如何与客户建立及维系关系</div>\n      <div class=\"content-text\">\n        <p>会员<span class=\"font-bold\">俱乐部</span>、积分<span class=\"font-bold\">制福利</span>兑换、电商<span class=\"font-bold\">优惠</span>组合等常规营销形式<br>\n        <span class=\"text-blue\">标签化标准、<br>\n        包装设计手册、<br>\n        品牌化战略、<br>\n        全球消费者服务机构</span></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 4b. Channels -->\n    <div class=\"grid-cell cell-channels\">\n      <div class=\"cell-title\">渠道通路</div>\n      <div class=\"cell-subtitle\">企业服务流程中的客户接触点</div>\n      <div class=\"content-text\">\n        <p>线上<span class=\"font-bold\">商城</span><br>\n        电商<span class=\"font-bold\">渠道</span><br>\n        产品<span class=\"font-bold\">销往</span>全球100多个<span class=\"font-bold\">国家</span>和<span class=\"font-bold\">地区</span></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 5. Customer Segments -->\n    <div class=\"grid-cell cell-segments\">\n      <div class=\"cell-title\">客户细分</div>\n      <div class=\"cell-subtitle\">所服务的客户群体分类</div>\n      <div class=\"content-text\">\n        <p>没有特别区分的<span class=\"font-bold\">大客户群体</span>，根据子品牌的<span class=\"font-bold\">不同锚定</span>细分消费者。</p>\n        <p class=\"mt-6\">到2030的目标：<br>\n        帮助5000万儿童<span class=\"font-bold\">拥有更</span>健康的生活</p>\n        <p class=\"mt-6\">在与<span class=\"font-bold\">雀巢</span>公司的商业<span class=\"font-bold\">活动</span>直接相关的<span class=\"font-bold\">社区</span>中，帮助3000万<span class=\"font-bold\">人改</span>善生活。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Bottom Left: Cost Structure -->\n    <div class=\"grid-cell cell-cost\">\n      <div class=\"cell-title\" style=\"text-align: left;\">成本结构</div>\n      <div class=\"cell-subtitle\">商业模式运转下所引发的成本</div>\n      <div class=\"cost-split\">\n        <div class=\"cost-item\">\n          <div class=\"vertical-label\">固定成本</div>\n          <div class=\"cost-desc\">\n            人力成本、技术研发运维成本、一般及行政开支、商品成本、门店运维成本\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"cost-item\">\n          <div class=\"vertical-label\">可变成本</div>\n          <div class=\"cost-desc\">\n            原料成本、广告营销活动成本、流量成本、包装成本、周边成本、其他成本\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Bottom Right: Revenue Streams -->\n    <div class=\"grid-cell cell-revenue\">\n      <div class=\"cell-title\" style=\"text-align: left;\">收入来源</div>\n      <div class=\"cell-subtitle\">企业通过向客户提供价值主张而获得的收入</div>\n      <div class=\"revenue-content\">\n        <p class=\"font-bold\">各类产品销售收入（95%来自食品的销售）</p>\n        <p class=\"font-bold\">投资收入</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
      },
